      "Section": "Custom Lists in Display Services",
      "Anchor": "custom-lists-in-display-services",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "With Sales Navigator Custom Lists, customers can organize workflow and keep track of leads, accounts, and existing clients. Display Services bring Custom Lists to external customer applications as part of the core experience in the iframe, and does so in a manner consistent with Custom Lists on mobile and the web.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Custom Lists in Display Services",
