    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Custom Lists in Display Services",
      "Anchor": "custom-lists-in-display-services",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Custom Lists only works with version 2.0 of Display Services and above.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "When Custom Lists are Displayed",
      "Anchor": "when-custom-lists-are-displayed",
      "SectionPath": [
        "When Custom Lists are Displayed"
      ],
      "Text": "Customers will have the opportunity to save leads and accounts to Custom Lists after clicking Save in Sales Navigator on the lead or company Top Card. After clicking this button, the Custom Lists dialog slides in, and the lead/account can be added to existing lists, or just saved generally by selecting All leads or All accounts:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "When Custom Lists are Displayed",
      "Anchor": "when-custom-lists-are-displayed",
      "SectionPath": [
        "When Custom Lists are Displayed"
      ],
      "Text": "New Custom Lists can also be created at this time. After a lead or account is saved, on the Top Card, a new Lists icon will be displayed so that existing lists this lead or account is on can be managed. Clicking this icon will bring up the Lists dialog.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
